Open-Prompted Anime Tools (OPAT) - License

======================================================================
1. Scope
======================================================================

This license (the "New BSD License", also known as the BSD 3-Clause
License) applies to the OPAT portal itself, namely:

  - index.html at the repository root
  - the JavaScript files that belong to the portal, including
    scripts/build-index.js and the generated apps/apps-index.js
  - the other files at the repository root that are not part of any
    individual application

It does NOT apply to the individual applications placed under
apps/<app_id>/ (see section 3).

